@classId = class-uuid-here

### 1. Get Users (Super Admin sees all across schools; Pagination, Filtering, Search)
GET {{baseUrl}}?page=1&limit=10&role=student&search=alex
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 1b. Get Users Filtered by School (Optional for Super Admin to target specific school)
GET {{baseUrl}}?schoolId={{schoolId}}&page=1&limit=10
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 3. Get User By Email
GET {{baseUrl}}/email?email=alex@Ross.com
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 3b. Get User By Email with explicit school context (if needed)
GET {{baseUrl}}/email?email=annet@Ross.com&schoolId={{schoolId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 4. Get Teachers By School (Super Admin can omit schoolId via query if service supports cross-school list, or pass schoolId)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teachers?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 5. Get All Students By School ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/students?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 6. Get Students By Class ID (Uncomment route in router if using)
# GET {{baseUrl}}/students/class/{{classId}}
# Cookie: token={{token}}

### 7. Check Admission Number Availability
GET {{baseUrl}}/check-admission?admissionNumber=ADM-2026-001&schoolId={{schoolId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 8. Bulk Update User Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/status/bulk?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userIds": ["uuid-1", "uuid-2"],
  "isActive": false
}

### 9. Get Users Count By Role
GET {{baseUrl}}/role/student/count?schoolId={{schoolId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 10. Get User By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 11. Update User Details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jane Updated Doe",
  "phone": "+254798765432"
}

### 12. Delete User
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 13. Update User Status (Activate/Deactivate)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}/status
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": true
}

### 14. Get Student Profile by User ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{userId}}/student-profile
Cookie: token={{token}}